WEBVTT

00:01:32.410 --> 00:01:33.860
<i>It's summertime!</i>

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:37.770
<i>My first summer in high 
school is going by quickly.</i>

00:01:37.770 --> 00:01:42.620
<i>The day we're to climb Mt. Fuji 
is also approaching quickly.</i>

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:44.130
Aoi!

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:46.080
Dawdle and I'll leave you behind!

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:49.750
Huh?! Wait a minute!

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:50.500
Mountain Trail

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:51.420
Season 2 - New Climb 7

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:53.750
Season 2 - New Climb 7 
 Encouragement of Swim?

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:03.140
It's so hot!

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:07.060
I wish we could stay in the pool all day.

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:10.020
Gym class is plenty for me!

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:12.980
Oh yeah, Aoi! Come with me after school!

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:14.360
Where to?

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:16.740
A <i>really</i> nice place!

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:22.990
Is the "nice place" the Hanno river beach?

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:24.680
We always come here.

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:27.000
No, it's further that way.

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:29.080
That way?

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:43.010
Are we there yet?

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:45.590
Just a bit further!

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:49.020
And now?

00:02:50.210 --> 00:02:52.520
Just how far are we going to walk?!

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:56.780
To a place upstream on the Iruma River, 
called Azuma Gorge.

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:58.780
Azuma Gorge{I confirmed - it really is just 2.2km from Higashi-Hannou Station to the Entrance to Azuma Gorge!}

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:58.780
Tohnosuyama 
Mountain

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:58.780
Azuma Gorge?

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:02.030
We've been walking for 
thirty minutes already.

00:03:02.390 --> 00:03:04.280
Just a little further, I said!

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:14.000
300m ahead

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:16.340
To DoReMiFa Bridge
No Crossing in High Water!

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:25.100
Look! Here we are.

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:36.360
Azuma Gorge

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:40.410
Well? Isn't it a nice place?

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:41.360
Yeah!

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:48.660
The air tastes great!

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:56.490
The breeze feels great!

00:03:59.490 --> 00:04:03.930
<i>To think there was a place like 
this in walking distance...</i>

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:09.930
Saitama Prefecture

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:08.530
<i>I'm sure there must be many others as well.</i>

00:04:12.740 --> 00:04:15.940
Of course, it's too late 
in the day for swimming.

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:21.610
Do... Re... Mi... Fa...{This really is called the 'Do Re Mi Fa Bridge'}

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:25.490
So... La... Ti... Do!

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:28.580
Wait a minute, Hinata!

00:04:29.140 --> 00:04:30.210
Aoi!

00:04:30.210 --> 00:04:34.760
Let's invite Kokona-chan and Kaede-san 
to go swimming together next time!

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:36.010
Together?

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:39.210
We need to build up strength if 
we're going to climb Mt. Fuji.

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:41.340
It'll count as training!

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:45.390
You say that, but don't 
you just want to swim?

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:47.680
Now, now... Okay...

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:50.600
We'll get together in sexy swimsuits!

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:52.600
S-Sexy?!

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:00.360
Yukimura

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:04.880
What kind of swimsuit is "sexy", anyway?

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:07.610
I only have my school swimsuit.

00:05:11.150 --> 00:05:12.700
Sexy...

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.340
Sexy?

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.130
Aww, jeez!

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:20.640
Say, Mom...

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:21.520
What is it?

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:24.620
If you want a snack, there's 
pudding in the fridge.

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:25.380
Really?!

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.610
I'll have some!

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:35.100
So yummy!

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:36.730
<i>No, wait!</i>

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:38.630
Say, Mom...

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:39.350
Se--

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:40.700
"Se"?

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:46.650
<i>No! I just can't ask her which 
kinds of swimsuits are sexy!</i>

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:49.520
S-Seibu Lions win the game today?

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:52.080
Aoi? You're interested in baseball now?

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:55.540
Popular & Cute Swimsuits!

00:05:56.280 --> 00:06:00.170
Sexy swimsuits... Sexy swimsuits...

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:03.470
I have no idea!

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:09.990
<i>Silly Aoi! You're in high school, yet you 
still don't have a single sexy swimsuit?!</i>

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:13.730
<i>Honestly, this is why you're still a child!</i>

00:06:15.670 --> 00:06:17.240
What was that, Hinata?!

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:19.610
I can at least manage a...

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:21.440
s-sexy swimsuit!

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:29.320
Hanno Real Estate

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:29.320
Okay!

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:36.080
Sexy... sexy...

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:42.380
How does this conceal anything?!

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:47.630
It's see-through!

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:52.510
It's just cords!

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:57.760
An invisible swimsuit?!

00:06:57.760 --> 00:06:59.580
Th-They actually make th--

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:01.980
Oh, it's just an empty hanger.

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:09.280
Still, there are so many of them, 
I don't know where to start...

00:07:10.020 --> 00:07:12.780
Miss, are you looking for something?

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:13.870
Uh, yes!

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:15.080
Um...

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:20.330
A slightly... s-sexy suit...

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:28.020
I went and bought one.

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:31.380
Hello, Aoi?

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:33.720
We're going to Azuma Gorge tomorrow!

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:36.910
Kaede-san and Kokona-chan said okay too!

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:38.970
Don't forget your sexy swimsuit!

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:40.900
Yes, I know!

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:43.510
<i>I can't wait!</i>

00:07:43.510 --> 00:07:44.880
<i>See you tomorrow!</i>

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:48.610
Stupid Hinata! I'll show you!

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:52.110
<i>The next day...</i>

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:59.370
<i>Typhoon 15 is steadily gaining 
speed as it approaches.</i>

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:03.630
<i>It is forecast to make land in 
the Kanto region past midnight.</i>

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:06.250
It'll be impossible to swim in this.

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:13.760
It's sunny!

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:15.890
Azuma Gorge

00:08:14.190 --> 00:08:15.890
The typhoon's passed!

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:18.150
But the river...

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:18.890
Yes...

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:27.130
We can't swim in that.

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:30.790
Okay, we'll retreat for today.

00:08:31.710 --> 00:08:32.900
Hinata?

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:41.080
Sorry, I caught a cold.

00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:46.340
<i>But I didn't end up catching a cold... 
Maybe it's just a superstition?</i>

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:48.340
<i>Well, all told...</i>

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:50.840
Azuma Gorge

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:50.840
<i>it wasn't until several days later...</i>

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:56.050
It's cloudy, but the air temperature is high,

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:58.440
so we should be able to swim.

00:08:58.440 --> 00:08:59.350
Yeah...

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:02.610
<i>Sexy swimsuit, huh...</i>

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:05.210
<i>I wore mine under my clothes,</i>

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:07.230
<i>but I'm still pretty embarrassed.</i>

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:10.050
Now, let's swim, everyone!

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:14.070
Huh? You're not undressing?

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:17.220
Kaede-san, are you getting undressed?

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:18.720
How about you, Aoi?

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:19.950
By all means, go ahead.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:25.550
You two are embarrassed to show 
your sexy swimsuits, aren't you?!

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:27.920
There's that too, but...

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:28.460
"But"?

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:31.540
The truth is, I can't swim.

00:09:33.690 --> 00:09:34.880
Unbelievable!

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:38.070
I thought you were awesome 
at all sports, Kaede-san!

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:39.840
You think too much of me...

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:43.630
Then, how about if we go sunbathing too?

00:09:43.630 --> 00:09:45.930
Sure, I can do that.

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:50.900
Hinata-san?

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:55.150
It's totally freezing! We can't swim in this!

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:59.330
Because the river is flowing, 
unlike with a pool,

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:02.910
the water temperature stays low even 
if the air temperature is high.

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:07.150
It's cloudy today, and there's no sun here,

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:10.630
plus the underground water feeds into it,

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:13.550
so the water temperature may be rather low.

00:10:14.310 --> 00:10:17.550
If I swim on a day like 
this, I'll catch cold again!

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:19.690
Retreat!

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:26.370
At last it's sunny!

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:27.810
Wow, it's hot!

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:30.810
Okay, everyone change to swimsuits!

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:38.390
D-Don't look too much.

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:43.020
I-It's not weird, is it?

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:49.650
What's this? Aoi, yours 
isn't particularly sexy!

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:51.710
You were so embarrassed about <i>that</i>?

00:10:52.050 --> 00:10:55.680
Come on, I've never worn 
one that shows my tummy!

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:58.340
Kokona-chan, yours is more daring.

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:00.770
R-Really?

00:11:00.770 --> 00:11:03.690
I just went with the 
salesperson's recommendation.

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:07.040
Kaede-san, your swimsuit is very cute.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:09.030
It's really not my style.

00:11:09.030 --> 00:11:11.140
A friend talked me into buying it.

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:14.520
Wait, why are you wearing clothes, Hinata?!

00:11:16.430 --> 00:11:18.740
You wanna see my sexy swimsuit?

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:21.030
Kurakami

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:24.230
Tadah!

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:26.410
Kurakami

00:11:24.230 --> 00:11:26.410
Your school swimsuit?!

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:29.600
How is that a sexy swimsuit?!

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:32.170
It's plenty cute when I wear it!

00:11:33.310 --> 00:11:35.170
Check it out:  Meow!

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:36.540
What's that?!

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:38.120
Jeez!

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:39.800
Take this!

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:42.920
I got you!

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:44.090
It's cold!

00:11:44.530 --> 00:11:46.220
This feels great.

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:49.350
<i>In the end,</i>

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:52.730
<i>we weren't able to swim{play in the water?} at Azuma Gorge,</i>

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:56.730
<i>but I still made another fun summer memory.</i>

00:11:57.740 --> 00:11:59.980
To Be Continued!
